<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάω</span></b>  (B), mostly 
			Ep.
		 in 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw, gather</i>
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ-, ἐπ-, καταμάομαι</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ταλάροισιν ἀμησάμενοι [γάλα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.247
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.859
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλότριον κάματον σφετέρην ἐς γαστέρ᾽
					ἀμῶνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					599
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμήσατο γαῖαν ἀμφ᾽ αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1305
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					5.169b
				</span></i>
			:—
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσὶν ἀμήσας κρατὸς ὕπερθε
				κόνιν,</span> of a mourner, <i>pouring</i> dust on his
			head, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.241
			</span></i> (Antip.).—Poet. and later Prose. (Cl. Lith.
				<i>sémti</i> 'draw (water)'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
